    {
      "text": "Figure 2: Execution pipeline architectures. (a) Solo Agent: the router selects a single solver agent to respond directly to the query. (b) Refining Agent: the router selects candidate solver agents (Solver Agent A, B, C) running in parallel, and a downstream Refining Agent aggregates and reconciles partial responses into a unified Final Answer.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
